y slowly floats up from the flower bed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_79","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_79","text":"What is that...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_80","text":"Anti-gravity technology. I applied it to everything here except the flowers and you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_81","text":"Generating anti-gravity is rudimentary technology. However, applying it only to specific targets...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_82","text":"is likely something far beyond your comprehension, hehe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_83","text":"Oh, not that I'm bragging.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_84","text":"I simply wanted to highlight the discrepancy between Planet Shifty and your planet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"nero","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_85","text":"That's basically the definition of bragging.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_86","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_86","text":"*Swoosh*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_87","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_87","text":"The floating chunk of machinery gets absorbed into Mekami Shifty's body.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_88","text":"That is one fragment recovered.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_89","text":"There aren't many left. Shall we go search for the next one?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_90","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_90","text":"Yeah, sure. Let's get this over with quickly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_91","text":"Indeed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_92","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_92","text":"Contrary to what she said, however, Mekami Shifty doesn't move from the flower bed. Instead, she looks around with a blank look on her face.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_93","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_93","text":"Biscuit approaches her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_94","text":"Do you like flowers?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_95","text":"I suppose you could say that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_96","text":"On Planet Shifty, there is nothing but cold rocks and steel.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_foolmetalpanic_05_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"mekamishifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_foolmetalpanic_05_97","text":"I was aware of the existence of